          CompareHub Nigeria — Nigeria's No. 1 Price Comparison Marketplace
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-work font-semibold text-[18px] text-[#181d25] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.45px]">Compare Prices on Everything You Need</h3>
          <p class="font-work text-[14px] text-[#364153] leading-[22.75px] tracking-[-0.15px]" style="max-width:1128px">
            CompareHub is Nigeria's largest price comparison platform. We help everyday Nigerians find the best deals on products from verified vendors across the country — all in one place. Whether you're shopping from the comfort of your home in Lagos, Abuja, Port Harcourt or anywhere in between, CompareHub lets you compare prices side-by-side and buy at the cheapest price without stress. Shop for smartphones, laptops, headphones, tablets, gaming consoles, or everyday food & groceries - and get the best price from our network of verified Nigerian vendors.  
          </p>
        </div>
        <hr class="border-[#f3f4f6] my-8">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-work font-semibold text-[18px] text-[#364153] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.45px]">Shop for Original Products at the Best Prices</h3>
          <p class="font-work text-[14px] text-[#364153] leading-[22.75px] tracking-[-0.15px]" style="max-width:1128px">
            CompareHub prides itself on listing only genuine, verified products from trusted Nigerian vendors — guaranteed lowest prices on original products with exclusive access to Flash Deals.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

